-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §137 קידום בדרגות: a kindergarten teacher is
-- promoted as an academic teacher under §38, by criteria the Ministry
-- adapted to kindergarten teachers in its letter to the union.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `38`

§ `137 קידום בדרגות`

@ref akn:art_137
GIVEN c IS A `candidate` @desc the kindergarten teacher; "meets the Ministry's criteria" read by the criteria adapted to kindergarten teachers
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a kindergarten teacher meets the conditions for the next grade` c IF
    `meets the conditions for the next grade` c
